---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { company } from '../content/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Moon Commerce Limited" description="How Moon Commerce handles personal information relating to this website and enquiries." canonical="/privacy/">
  <PageIntro label="Website policies" title="Privacy Policy" description="This policy explains how Moon Commerce handles personal information connected with this website and enquiries." />
  <section class="section light legal-site">
    <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>{company.registeredName} is the controller for personal information we handle in relation to this website and direct enquiries. Our <a href="/company-information/">company information</a> page gives our registration details and postal address.</p>

      <h2>Website visits</h2>
      <p>The website is informational. It has no website contact form, customer account, analytics scripts or advertising tags. Our hosting provider may process technical data such as IP addresses, browser information and request logs to deliver, secure and troubleshoot the website.</p>

      <h2>Enquiries</h2>
      <p>If you contact us through a channel listed on our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>, we may use your details, organisation and message to respond, follow up and keep a record of the conversation. We rely on our legitimate interests in managing business communications and operating the site, where appropriate. We may also process information to take steps you request before entering a contract or to comply with a legal obligation.</p>

      <h2>Service providers and retention</h2>
      <p>Hosting and communication providers may receive data needed to deliver their services. External platforms, including LinkedIn, describe their own processing in their privacy policies. The duration of processing depends on the purpose, including the time needed to handle an enquiry, maintain records, keep the website secure or meet legal requirements.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Subject to applicable law, you may have rights to access, correct or erase personal information, restrict or object to its use, or request portability. You can write to our registered office with a privacy request. In the UK you can also raise a concern with the <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/">Information Commissioner’s Office</a>.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>See the <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a> for how this website uses browser storage.</p>
    </div></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
